<title>JAPAN: MOF says has not heard details of NCB's reform.</title>
<headline>MOF says has not heard details of NCB's reform.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance has not heard the details of Nippon Credit Bank's restructuring plans, Vice Finance Minister Tadashi Ogawa told reporters on Thursday.</p>
</text>
